2.Customer Support Bot
Create variables  
dtCustomer – type: DataTable
customerRow –type: DataRow
status – type: String
amount – type: Double
orderID – string
email – string
customerName – string
customerID - string
1) drag activity – use excel file
     Workbook path—location of the excel file
2) In Do part – drag read range
   Range-- Excel.Sheet("Sheet1")
And also change output as -- dtCustomer
3) next add input dialog
  Title-- "Customer Support"
  Input label – "Enter Customer ID:"
  Value entered – customerID
*also change result as customerID in properties
4) add assign – variable : customerRow
Value : dtCustomer.AsEnumerable().FirstOrDefault(Function(row) row("CustomerID").ToString.Trim = customerID.Trim)
5) drag IF 
Condition: customerRow IsNot Nothing
6) THEN part—assign—variable : customerName
 Value : customerRow("CustomerName").ToString
7) add another assign below this
Variable : email
Value: customerRow("Email").ToString
8) add another assign 
Variable: orderID
Value: customerRow("OrderID").ToString
9) assign – variable : amount 
Value: Convert.ToDouble(customerRow("Amount"))
10) assign – variable : status
Value : customerRow("Status").ToString
11)add message box text: "Customer Name: " + customerName + Environment.NewLine +
"Email: " + email + Environment.NewLine +
"Order ID: " + orderID + Environment.NewLine +
"Total Amount: ₹" + amount.ToString("0.00") + Environment.NewLine +
"Order Status: " + status
12) ELSE 
 Add message box  text: "Customer not found. Please check the Customer ID."
